/*
 *	ktest_v8.c
 *	V8 as a process (design 17.19): tests/uprog/v8prog.cc, on the boot
 *	volume as /boot/V8PROG.ELF when the build was made with BROWSER=1
 *	(tools/browser/build.sh). It starts V8, runs a script and compares
 *	its answer; its exit code says whether the answer was right. Every
 *	page it used comes back (but a few that other tasks may take
 *	meanwhile). Then it runs loops that V8 compiles to machine code, and
 *	the same loops without machine code (--jitless), and the first must
 *	be the faster. Skipped when the program is not on the volume. Skia
 *	in a window and the application ブラウザ are tried after it.
 */

